      "description": "Each faction accuses another of taking the sealed map. The Guild suspects the Brotherhood, the Captains suspect the Guild of staging the theft, and the Wardens will not say what they know.",
      "faction_ids": ["fac_coin_guild", "fac_black_sails", "fac_tether_captains", "fac_vent_wardens"]
